Package: lang-server
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: HA4FPAI maintainers <maintainers@ha4fpai.invalid>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3 (<< 3.9), python3-venv, ca-certificates, alsa-utils, mpg123, adduser, init-system-helpers (>= 1.56)
Description: Online-first language and voice services for Ubuntu 20.04 arm64
 Private Python environment, HTTP and Wyoming endpoints, and microphone loop.
 Model downloads run separately without loading models or blocking installation.
